ARCHITECTURE (mirrors the sibling CommandSearch surface; all 1436 feature-views are Shared-free)
  • SwiftUI View `SearchPage` + `@Observable @MainActor SearchPageModel` (P1/S8). No networking in the view.
  • Data source seam `GlobalSearchSource.search(_:)` = web `useGlobalSearch` → GET /search?q=&types=&limit=
    (web/src/api/hooks/useSearch.ts). `InMemoryGlobalSearchSource` backs previews/tests; the app composition
    root injects the production KMP-backed source (ADR-004). Hook name `useGlobalSearch` preserved in docs +
    `GlobalSearchRequest`/`GlobalSearchSource` call sites.
  • Pure projector `SearchPageProjector` ports the web derived state verbatim: trim + SEARCH_MIN_QUERY_LENGTH(2)
    guard, `typesFilter` known-kind filter, `groupedHits` canonical-order bucketing dropping empties, and the
    render cascade idle/too-short/error/loading/no-results/results (+ placeholderData keep-prev behavior).
  • Tokens only (P1/S9): Color.TS / Font.TS / TSSpacing / TSRadius; glass via TSGlassPanel material (ADR-005).
  • i18n via `SearchPageStrings` resolving the default Localizable catalog with web English fallbacks (ADR-014).
  • a11y: facet `aria-pressed`→`.isSelected`, combined row labels, results-region label/value, Dynamic Type,
    light/dark + increased-contrast tokens, ≥44pt targets (ADR-015). SI display boundary via shared converters.

